        "x1": 0.7454117975315127,
        "y1": 0.8740376089644262
      },
      "text": "properties, from which the corresponding wavelet function (mother wavelet) is derived [31].",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
